    {
      "id": "0b67b601-0018-4abd-b9ac-25be2d70cf64",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "// Java 7: @SafeVarargs only on static, final, or constructor\r\n// Java 9: also allowed on private instance methods\r\n\r\nclass Container<T> {\r\n    @SafeVarargs                          // NEW in Java 9\r\n    private void process(T... items) {    // private instance method\r\n        for (T item : items) doWork(item);\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "5d10939f-b760-406e-af10-b7f334ec822e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Underscore as variable",
