    {
      "id": "d3f04cc6-43e4-4dfe-9f58-970991172b05",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "// Returns the index of the first mismatch, or -1 if equal\r\nint[] a = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};\r\nint[] b = {1, 2, 7, 4, 5};\r\nArrays.mismatch(a, b); // 2 (index 2 differs: 3 vs 7)\r\n\r\nint[] c = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};\r\nArrays.mismatch(a, c); // -1 (equal)\r\n\r\n// Range variant\r\nArrays.mismatch(a, 1, 4, b, 1, 4); // mismatch in [1,4)\r\n\r\n// Works for all types: byte[], char[], Object[], etc.\r\nString[] sa = {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"};\r\nString[] sb = {\"a\", \"x\", \"c\"};\r\nArrays.mismatch(sa, sb); // 1",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "fdfd1885-7cc6-4041-87a7-677088baec41",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Objects API Changes",
