    {
      "id": "733e7ebb-a1f4-4cb9-a31c-acbccd9364fe",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "// requireNonNullElse — return value or default (not null)\r\nString name = Objects.requireNonNullElse(getName(), \"Unknown\");\r\n// If getName() returns null → \"Unknown\". If default is null → NPE.\r\n\r\n// requireNonNullElseGet — lazy supplier version\r\nString name2 = Objects.requireNonNullElseGet(getName(), () -> computeDefault());\r\n\r\n// checkIndex — bounds checking\r\nObjects.checkIndex(5, 10);   // 5 — valid index in [0,10)\r\nObjects.checkIndex(10, 10);  // throws IndexOutOfBoundsException\r\n\r\n// checkFromToIndex — range check [fromIndex, toIndex)\r\nObjects.checkFromToIndex(2, 5, 10); // OK: [2,5) is within [0,10)\r\nObjects.checkFromToIndex(2, 11, 10);// throws\r\n\r\n// checkFromIndexSize — [fromIndex, fromIndex+size)\r\nObjects.checkFromIndexSize(2, 5, 10); // OK: [2,7) within [0,10)",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "44a7473d-914d-48f2-be91-1ffb5dc89e25",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## String Enhancements",
